@startuml ssd-report-metrics
' Reasoning: metric reporting is black-box from the probe perspective. The
' platform accepts normalized samples and later exposes aggregate metrics.
title BEACON - SSD - Report Metrics

autonumber

actor "Probe Runtime" as probe
participant "BEACON Platform" as beacon

probe -> beacon : Report normalized metric samples
beacon --> probe : Return accepted sample count and receipt time

@enduml
